description: Catering Studio architecture rules
globs:
  - src/agents/catering/**
  - src/agents/catering_followup/**
  - src/platform/catering_*.py
  - web/frontend/src/sections/catering/**
  - web/backend/app/routers/catering.py
alwaysApply: false
---

Read and enforce `docs/governance/projects/catering-studio.md`.

Hermes owns interpretation, extraction, clarification, qualification and all
customer/owner-facing language. Deterministic Catering kernels own identity,
authorization, canonical item IDs, integer-cents money, pricebook import,
pricing, lead and proposal state, quote versions, approval enforcement,
idempotency, persistence, send eligibility, follow-up policy, audit and
rollback.

Presumed NO-GO: a second menu-ingestion pipeline, pricebook importer, proposal
lifecycle, approval workflow, owner-notification mechanism, parallel lead or
proposal store, custom clarification trees, or hand-authored JSON where Hermes
can extract the data.

These rules apply to Catering paths only. Never apply them to Flyer Studio.
